Only if the user explicitly asks: follow .claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md.
The graphify CLI is NOT installed globally. Use the project-local build-box venv:
/workspace/tools/graphify-env/bin/graphify. Keep the query log OFF: export GRAPHIFY_QUERY_LOG_DISABLE=1.
Never point graphify at data that holds real PHI.
